Title: "DHIS2 original name"
Description: "The name the DHIS2 instance holds for the object this resource publishes, stated where the run published that name in rewritten wording. A run under the substitute posture rewrites a name carrying a comparison character into the words it stands for, and this states the instance's own spelling beside it, so a consumer reading a rewritten name can search the instance on the name the instance answers to."
